# Returned schoolwork. The repo is public and serves GitHub Pages, so scans of
# graded tests — a child's name, handwriting and marks — must never be pushed.
# The analysis derived from them stays local too: what gets committed is the
# practice questions it produces, which look like any other content.
_returned/*
!_returned/README.md
